    "created_at": "2022-01-21T17:37:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-01-21T17:37:16Z",
    "body": "Some of this may be a symptom of how I tend to discourage any use of [NewObject]/[SameObject] in specs I review and mentor, since they are just documentation that is easy to get out of sync with the normative algorithms. (See previous discussions about some new version of [SameObject] which has normative power...)",
